        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kauh liangmei khou Raguang Himdaimei sudiu!",
            "Chuzaengmei nai diu;",
            "Kalung kunloumei khou",
            "Banchra nun lu kagaeng Bethlehem rukhou",
            "Kandi rui kaodao diu banchra nun lu kiu.",
            "",
            "2. Khristian nun lungthau diu",
            "Puanpui khuan chu khou",
            "Ngang phaengna zau kudiu",
            "Banchra nun biak thang",
            "Tingpuk kachin lik the, neila lukhuan rui",
            "Kauh le dih khou chuzaengmei nai diu tu e.",
            "",
            "3. Jehovah thauh teilou nimei nga na le",
            "Immanuel ‘niu ta bam nduanglou khang",
            "Nrian lou mei Mesiah kiu kamei e;",
            "Meinun ni neilapui khuan hazam kau diu",
            "",
            "4. Raguang le mansei ta zaikariu lou the",
            "Kau banchra kangdai lu hei kumna suan e;",
            "Lauziu gaengmei nun chu puanpui zingbang khou,",
            "Duan gai panti lungsing diu ‘niu Guang Jisu!"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
